#: src/ctlpanel.c:359
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:360
msgid "Look"
msgstr "外观"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:361
msgid "Colour preset for window chrome and synui's own panels"
msgstr "窗口边框和 synui 自身面板的配色预设"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:362
msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "壁纸"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:368
msgid "Wallpaper accent"
msgstr "取壁纸的强调色"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:371
msgid ""
"Take the accent off the wallpaper instead of the theme. Auto is Prism (light "
"or dark), which is built on it, and nothing else"
msgstr ""
"从壁纸而不是主题取强调色。自动是以它为基础的 Prism（浅色或深色），除此之外没"
"有别的"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:386
msgid "RGB lights"
msgstr "RGB 灯光"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:388
msgid "Put the wallpaper's accent on RGB hardware (needs openrgb)"
msgstr "把壁纸的强调色送到 RGB 硬件上（需要 openrgb）"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:389
msgid "Cursor theme"
msgstr "光标主题"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:391
msgid "UI font"
msgstr "界面字体"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:392
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文字"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:393
msgid "The family every synui panel draws in. Previews live; Esc puts it back"
msgstr "每个 synui 面板绘制所用的字体族。预览是实时的，Esc 可以撤回"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:406
msgid "Font size"
msgstr "字号"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:409
msgid "Applications: GTK, Qt and the terminal. Applies when you stop"
msgstr "应用程序：GTK、Qt 和终端。停下来时才应用"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:410
msgid "Text scale"
msgstr "文字缩放"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:413
msgid "The bar and the SYNAPSE apps — Files, Settings, Disks, Software"
msgstr "顶栏和 SYNAPSE 的各个程序 — 文件、设置、磁盘、软件"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:415
msgid "Transparency"
msgstr "透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:416 src/ctlpanel.c:428
msgid "Glass"
msgstr "玻璃"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:417
msgid "Focused-window opacity. Left/Right adjust; Enter switches it off"
msgstr "当前窗口的不透明度。左右键调整，回车关闭"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:437
msgid ""
"Auto follows the theme · Off is never glass · or set how much you see through"
msgstr "自动跟随主题 · 关闭则永不使用玻璃 · 也可以自己设定透出多少"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:443
msgid "Sync all glass"
msgstr "所有玻璃统一"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:446
msgid ""
"Every surface follows Glass above. Change one and it keeps its own until you "
"switch this back on"
msgstr ""
"每个界面都跟随上面的“玻璃”。单独改过的会保留自己的值，直到你把这一项重新打开"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:448
msgid "Legibility correction"
msgstr "可读性校正"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:451
msgid ""
"Surfaces go less see-through where their text would not read. Off draws "
"exactly what you asked for"
msgstr "在文字会看不清的地方，界面会变得不那么透明。关闭则完全按你设定的绘制"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:467
msgid "Live backdrop"
msgstr "实时背景"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:470
msgid ""
"Menus and panels ink themselves off the window behind them rather than the "
"wallpaper it covers. Lands within a second"
msgstr "菜单和面板从背后的窗口取色，而不是从被它遮住的壁纸。一秒内生效"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:472
msgid "Unfocused opacity"
msgstr "非活动窗口的不透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:475
msgid "How far windows you are not using fade back"
msgstr "你没有在用的窗口后退多少"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:476
msgid "Terminal glass"
msgstr "终端玻璃"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:479
msgid "foot draws its own background alpha, so it needs its own level"
msgstr "foot 自己绘制背景透明度，所以需要单独的一档"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:489
msgid "Make it all solid"
msgstr "全部变为不透明"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:490
msgid "Glass off and windows opaque, in one press. The rows above put it back"
msgstr "一按即关闭玻璃并让窗口不透明。上面几行可以改回来"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:509
msgid "Make it all clear"
msgstr "全部变为透明"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:510
msgid ""
"Bar, dock and menus lose their background entirely, inked off the wallpaper. "
"The rows above put it back"
msgstr "顶栏、程序坞和菜单完全失去背景，改为从壁纸取色。上面几行可以改回来"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:513 src/ctlpanel.c:514
msgid "CRT effects"
msgstr "CRT 效果"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:515
msgid "The GLES post-process pass. Off on renderers that have none"
msgstr "GLES 后期处理。在没有该能力的渲染器上为关闭"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:516
msgid "All filters"
msgstr "所有滤镜"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:517 src/filters.c:85
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "扫描线"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:520
msgid "Screen curve"
msgstr "屏幕弯曲"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:523 src/filters.c:87
msgid "Chromatic aberration"
msgstr "色差"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:526
msgid "Glitch on alert"
msgstr "警报时的画面干扰"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:530
msgid "Phosphor tint"
msgstr "荧光色"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:531 src/filters.c:89
msgid "Phosphor"
msgstr "荧光"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:534
msgid "Off leaves the picture in colour; the blend below is what applies it"
msgstr "关闭会让画面保持彩色；真正应用它的是下面的混合度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:535
msgid "Phosphor blend"
msgstr "荧光混合"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:538
msgid "Blend toward the phosphor tint. Bloom only bites once this is up"
msgstr "向荧光色靠拢。只有把这一项调高，泛光才起作用"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:539
msgid "Phosphor glow"
msgstr "荧光辉光"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:542 src/filters.c:92
msgid "Phosphor lift"
msgstr "荧光底光"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:545
msgid "How far the unlit field glows: 0 keeps it black, up lights the raster"
msgstr "未点亮的区域发光多少：0 保持全黑，调高会点亮栅格"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:546 src/filters.c:93
msgid "Phosphor hue"
msgstr "荧光色相"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:549
msgid ""
"Turns the tint's colour: down is redder (amber to orange), up yellower. 0.50 "
"is the preset"
msgstr "旋转色调：向下偏红（琥珀到橙），向上偏黄。0.50 是预设值"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:557
msgid "Titlebars"
msgstr "标题栏"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:558
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "边框"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:559
msgid "Server-side titlebars, on every window at once"
msgstr "服务端标题栏，一次作用于所有窗口"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:560
msgid "Titlebar height"
msgstr "标题栏高度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:563
msgid "0 removes the titlebar; below 14 there is no room for a button"
msgstr "0 会去掉标题栏；低于 14 就放不下按钮"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:564
msgid "Border width"
msgstr "边框宽度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:567
msgid "Corner radius"
msgstr "圆角半径"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:570
msgid "Forced square while maximized, so nothing pokes past the output"
msgstr "最大化时强制为直角，免得超出屏幕"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:572
msgid "Tiling gap"
msgstr "平铺间距"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:573 src/ctlpanel.c:747
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "布局"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:576
msgid "Master area"
msgstr "主区域"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:579
msgid "Share of the screen the master window takes when tiling"
msgstr "平铺时主窗口占据屏幕的比例"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:580
msgid "Cascade pile size"
msgstr "层叠堆的深度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:584
msgid "How deep a cascade pile may get once the grid of piles is full"
msgstr "当堆叠网格排满后，一摞层叠最多能叠多深"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:586
msgid "Drop shadow"
msgstr "投影"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:587
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "阴影"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:590
msgid "Shadow softness"
msgstr "阴影柔和度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:593
msgid "Shadow spread"
msgstr "阴影扩展"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:596
msgid "Solid shadow before the falloff starts — what gives it weight"
msgstr "在衰减开始前的实心阴影 — 分量就来自这里"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:597
msgid "Shadow offset X"
msgstr "阴影偏移 X"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:600
msgid "Shadow offset Y"
msgstr "阴影偏移 Y"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:603
msgid "Crop client shadows"
msgstr "裁掉客户端的阴影"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:606
msgid "Hides the invisible margin apps like Firefox draw their own shadow in"
msgstr "隐藏 Firefox 之类程序用来画自己阴影的那圈看不见的边距"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:608
msgid "Backdrop blur"
msgstr "背景模糊"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:609
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "模糊"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:612
msgid "Frosts what is behind a translucent window. Opaque ones cost nothing"
msgstr "把半透明窗口背后的东西磨成毛玻璃。不透明的窗口不耗性能"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:613
msgid "Blur passes"
msgstr "模糊次数"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:616
msgid "Blur radius"
msgstr "模糊半径"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:619
msgid "Blur noise"
msgstr "模糊噪点"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:622
msgid "Blur brightness"
msgstr "模糊亮度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:625
msgid "Blur contrast"
msgstr "模糊对比度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:628
msgid "Blur saturation"
msgstr "模糊饱和度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:631
msgid "Blur halo"
msgstr "模糊光晕"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:634
msgid "How far the blur reaches past the window. 0 keeps it inside the frame"
msgstr "模糊向窗口外扩散多远。0 会让它留在边框以内"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:641
msgid "Window open"
msgstr "窗口打开"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:642
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "动画"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:645
msgid ""
"How a window arrives. Closing is not animated: the client's buffer is gone "
"the moment it unmaps"
msgstr "窗口如何出现。关闭不做动画：客户端一取消映射，它的缓冲就没有了"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:647
msgid "Window length"
msgstr "窗口时长"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:650
msgid "0 jumps straight to the end state. Also times the niri strip slide"
msgstr "0 会直接跳到最终状态。它也决定 niri 条带的滑动"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:651
msgid "Rise distance"
msgstr "上升距离"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:654
msgid ""
"How far a Rise window travels up into place. Ignored by the other styles"
msgstr "上升式窗口向上走多远才就位。其他样式会忽略这一项"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:655
msgid "Desktop switch"
msgstr "切换桌面"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:658
msgid ""
"Fade cross-fades the two desks; Slide sends them off the way you switched; "
"Cube turns the desk in 3D"
msgstr ""
"淡入淡出会让两个桌面交叠；滑动会朝你切换的方向送走它们；立方体则在三维中转动"
"桌面"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:660
msgid "Desktop length"
msgstr "切换时长"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:663
msgid ""
"A slide wants longer than a fade — the eye has to follow it somewhere — and "
"a cube wants longer again; try 400-600"
msgstr ""
"滑动比淡入淡出需要更久 — 眼睛得跟着它走 — 立方体又更久一些；可以试 400-600"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:665
msgid "Easing"
msgstr "缓动曲线"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:668
msgid ""
"Shared by both, and by the strip slide: two easings read as two desktops"
msgstr "两者共用，条带滑动也用：两条曲线看起来就像两个桌面"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:669
msgid "Desktops span"
msgstr "桌面的范围"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:672
msgid ""
"Shared: one desktop across every monitor. Per-monitor: each screen remembers "
"its own, and the switch moves only the focused one"
msgstr "共用：所有显示器共一个桌面。每屏：各自记住自己的，切换只移动当前那一个"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:678
msgid "Focus follows"
msgstr "焦点跟随"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:679
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "行为"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:682
msgid ""
"Click: only a click focuses. Sloppy and Strict follow the pointer; over the "
"desktop, Strict drops focus, Sloppy keeps it"
msgstr ""
"点击：只有点击才给焦点。宽松和严格都跟随指针；在桌面上方，严格会放掉焦点，宽"
"松则保留"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:684
msgid "Focus delay"
msgstr "焦点延迟"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:687
msgid ""
"How long the pointer rests before focus follows it. 0 is instant, which also "
"focuses windows you only crossed over"
msgstr "指针停留多久之后焦点才跟过去。0 是立即，那样只是掠过的窗口也会拿到焦点"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:689
msgid "Edge snapping"
msgstr "边缘吸附"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:691
msgid "Drag a window to an edge to fill that half or quarter"
msgstr "把窗口拖到边缘，即可填满那一半或那一角"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:692
msgid "Snap zone"
msgstr "吸附范围"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:695
msgid ""
"How close to the edge a drag arms the snap. Raise it on a high-DPI panel, or "
"if a fast pointer crosses the band"
msgstr ""
"拖动到离边缘多近才触发吸附。高分屏上可以调大，指针太快跨过这条带时也可以"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:697
msgid "Remember window size"
msgstr "记住窗口大小"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:699
msgid "Reopen each app where and how big it was when it closed"
msgstr "每个程序都按关闭时的位置和大小重新打开"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:701
msgid "Alt+Tab is mission control"
msgstr "Alt+Tab 即总览"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:702
msgid "Alt+Tab"
msgstr "Alt+Tab"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:704
msgid ""
"On, Alt+Tab opens the whole desk. Off, the MRU thumbnail strip — and the "
"three rows below describe that strip"
msgstr ""
"开启时 Alt+Tab 打开整个桌面。关闭时是按最近使用排列的缩略图条 — 下面三行说的"
"就是这个条"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:706
msgid "Alt+Tab previews"
msgstr "Alt+Tab 预览"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:708
msgid "The thumbnail grid. Off, Alt+Tab still cycles — silently"
msgstr "缩略图网格。关闭后 Alt+Tab 依然会切换 — 只是不显示"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:709
msgid "Alt+Tab across desktops"
msgstr "Alt+Tab 跨桌面"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:711
msgid "Alt+Tab reaches minimized"
msgstr "Alt+Tab 能取到最小化的窗口"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:721
msgid "Panels follow the pointer"
msgstr "面板跟随指针"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:722
msgid "Panels"
msgstr "面板"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:725
msgid ""
"On, an open panel moves to whichever monitor the pointer is on. Off, it "
"stays on the monitor you opened it on"
msgstr "开启时，打开的面板会移到指针所在的显示器。关闭则留在你打开它的那块屏上"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:731
msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "计算器"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:734
msgid ""
"Window: drag it by the header, click elsewhere freely. Clickoff: closes when "
"you click away. Esc always closes"
msgstr ""
"窗口：拖标题栏移动，别处随意点击。点外面关闭：点到旁边就关。Esc 始终可以关闭"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:736
msgid "Control panel"
msgstr "控制面板"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:739
msgid "How this panel itself behaves"
msgstr "这个面板自己的行为"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:740 src/ctlpanel.c:1276
msgid "Task manager"
msgstr "任务管理器"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:743
msgid "How the task manager behaves"
msgstr "任务管理器的行为"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:748
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "桌面"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:749
msgid "Of the desktop you are on — layout is per-desktop, not global"
msgstr "你当前所在桌面的 — 布局是按桌面记的，不是全局"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:750
msgid "Mission control"
msgstr "总览"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:751
msgid "Every window on this desktop at once, and the desktops themselves"
msgstr "一次看到这个桌面上的所有窗口，以及桌面本身"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:752
msgid "Desktop icons"
msgstr "桌面图标"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:754
msgid "Draw ~/Desktop on the wallpaper"
msgstr "把 ~/Desktop 画在壁纸上"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:755
msgid "Icon order"
msgstr "图标排序"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:758
msgid "Desktop widgets"
msgstr "桌面小组件"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:769
msgid "Widget glass"
msgstr "小组件玻璃"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:772
msgid "Desktop widgets take the dock's glass instead of the HUD panel"
msgstr "桌面小组件采用程序坞的玻璃，而不是 HUD 面板的"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:774 src/ctlpanel.c:775
msgid "Dock"
msgstr "程序坞"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:776
msgid "Dock auto-hide"
msgstr "自动隐藏程序坞"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:780
msgid "Dock above windows"
msgstr "程序坞置于窗口之上"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:781
msgid ""
"Off, windows cover a pinned dock. Auto-hide always arrives on top — it is "
"summoned over whatever is there"
msgstr ""
"关闭时，窗口会盖住固定的程序坞。自动隐藏的那种总是出现在最上面 — 它是被叫到一"
"切之上的"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:783
msgid "Dock edge"
msgstr "程序坞位置"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:786
msgid "Dock size"
msgstr "程序坞大小"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:792
msgid "The slab AND the icons in it — the icons are this minus 16"
msgstr "底板和其中的图标都算 — 图标是这个数值减 16"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:793
msgid "Dock reveal strip"
msgstr "唤出程序坞的边条"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:796
msgid "How close to the edge the pointer must get to bring it back"
msgstr "指针要离边缘多近才能把它唤回来"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:797
msgid "Dock magnify"
msgstr "程序坞放大"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:798
msgid "The icons under the pointer swell and the row slides apart to make room"
msgstr "指针下的图标会胀大，整排向两边让开腾出空间"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:806
msgid "Dock magnify amount"
msgstr "放大幅度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:813
msgid ""
"How big the icon under the pointer gets. The dock makes room for it, so a "
"big swell is a taller dock"
msgstr "指针下的图标能变多大。程序坞会为它让位，所以胀得越大坞就越高"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:822
msgid "Dock style"
msgstr "程序坞样式"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:823
msgid "Dock look"
msgstr "程序坞外观"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:826
msgid "Glass frosts the wallpaper behind the bar. Auto follows the theme"
msgstr "玻璃会把栏后的壁纸磨成毛玻璃。自动跟随主题"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:827
msgid "Dock opacity"
msgstr "程序坞不透明度"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:841
msgid "0.00 leaves the icons alone on the wallpaper; 1.00 hides it completely"
msgstr "0.00 只在壁纸上留下图标；1.00 则完全遮住"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:843
msgid "Dock corners"
msgstr "程序坞圆角"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:849
msgid "Its own, not the window radius. Caps at half the dock's size"
msgstr "它自己的，不是窗口圆角。上限是程序坞大小的一半"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:851
msgid "Show all apps button"
msgstr "显示“所有应用”按钮"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:852
msgid "Dock buttons"
msgstr "程序坞按钮"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:853
msgid ""
"A grid of dots at the end of the dock. Always opens the application overlay"
msgstr "程序坞末端的一格点阵。始终打开应用总览"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:870
msgid "Apps button position"
msgstr "应用按钮位置"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:871
msgid ""
"Where the all-apps button sits along the run. Dragging the button on the "
"dock sets the same thing"
msgstr "该按钮沿程序坞排在哪里。在坞上拖动这个按钮效果相同"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:873
msgid "Show power button"
msgstr "显示电源按钮"

#: src/ctlpanel.c:874
msgid ""
"A power mark past the apps button. Clicking it opens a menu — Lock, Log Out, "
"Suspend, Restart, Shut Down"
msgstr ""
